WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Ask Omar lives in the top menubar.

00:03.000 --> 00:11.000
Ask for a small task on disposable example files.

00:11.000 --> 00:14.000
Pi completes the task. Omar reports what changed.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
Show chat reveals the request and its answer.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.000
Keep a thought in a local Scratchpad note.

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Close the note. Choose Capture window from the bar.

00:28.000 --> 00:33.000
Select the example document using Omarchy's picker.

00:33.000 --> 00:36.000
The screenshot is saved; its file path is copied.

00:36.000 --> 00:43.500
Open the actual saved screenshot in an image viewer.
